   "Curriculum song (Prep A, prep-a.half-note). Original music and words for this app. The words are a rainy day (at the parent's request: the earlier \"tap, tap, stretch\" words, the same in both hands, were hard to sing apart); each half note is a word to stretch: pat, fall, splash, boom, roars, glows."
